SUMMARY:IPCAI 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Conference on Information Processing in Computer-
 Assisted Interventions\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial 
 source: https://sites.google.com/view/ipcai2027\nVenue Radar: https://gon
 -uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ipcai-2027\nNotes: 18th annual IPCAI (since 2
 010)\, held with CARS 2027 (Jun 28-Jul 1) at Langenbeck-Virchow-Haus\, Be
 rlin\; no remote option is announced (2022-24 were hybrid). All cutoffs a
 re 23:59 PT. Regular papers needed the Oct 23 intention and closed Oct 30
 \, 2026\; accepted papers get a final IJCARS review for the IPCAI special
  issue. Long abstracts are listed in the IPCAI-CARS proceedings\; accepte
 d Track 1 work may be submitted as an IJCARS short communication. CMT red
 irects to a login page\, so the portal was not verified open. IPCAI 2026 
 accepted 75 regular papers and 24 long abstracts. Size is an editorial es
 timate.
CATEGORIES:Healthcare & Clinical AI,Control & Robotics,Biomedical Imaging,C
 omputer Vision & Pattern Recognition
